{"title":"Hiking at Rouge National Urban Park","startsAt":"2026-11-07T12:00:00-05:00","endsAt":"2026-11-07T15:00:00-05:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"Lets hike at Rouge National Urban Park. This is a popular hiking spot close to the city. Pls aim to arrive 12pm. We will wait 15 mins for people to show up and then start walking at 12:15pm. Washrooms may or may not be available. Pls stop at a McD or Tim Hortons before the hike if needed.\n\n**Meeting Spot** \\- SEE BELOW COMMENTS\n\n**Transportation**\nNo TTC access. You must drive/rideshare/carpool to reach the Meeting Spot.\n\n**Distance**: 6 to 9km (we will adjust the distance based on weather and how much energy we have that day).\n\n**Difficulty**: Mostly Easy but some uphill and downhill.\n\n**Carpool**: Post in comments if offering/requesting carpool.\n\n💬 **Stay Connected:**\n***Join Whatsapp Group - [CLICK HERE](https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSflzD3fDrU5sLARAT5yDF3OhEu3Vj-2P7ci8mP5FYX46rt1NQ/viewform)***\n***Follow on Instagram - [CLICK HERE](https://www.instagram.com/tam.club/)***","venue":{"address":""},"fee":null,"group":"Toronto Asian Meetup - TAM","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/3/9/f/7/highres_515054839.jpeg"}